msgid "Online service URLs, one per line"
msgstr "URLs de servicios online, una por línea"

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"One HTTP or HTTPS URL per line. Add, edit, remove or reorder the lines; the "
"first one is the default. KGpg placeholders: $$FPR$$, $$ID16$$ and $$ID8$$; "
"in lowercase: $$fpr$$, $$id16$$ and $$id8$$."
msgstr ""
"Una URL HTTP o HTTPS por línea. Añade, edita, elimina o mueve las líneas; la "
"primera es la predeterminada. Marcadores de KGpg: $$FPR$$, $$ID16$$ y $$ID8$"
"$; en minúsculas: $$fpr$$, $$id16$$ y $$id8$$."

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:71
